{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"32":"Chapters on Dress"},"section_detail":{"32":{"hadithnumber_first":3550,"hadithnumber_last":3656,"arabicnumber_first":3550,"arabicnumber_last":3656,"name_native":"Chapters on Dress"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3620,"arabicnumber":3620,"text":"It was narrated from Ibn Buraidah, from his father, that an-Najashi sent a pair of pure black Khuff as a gift to the Prophet (ﷺ) of, which he wore","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":32,"hadith":71}}]}